[2] Proof readout
  automatic_word is the side-channel warning layer; it has many mixed
  route fibers.
  residue_terminal_fiber sharply reduces but does not eliminate mixing.
  magnitude_cocycle is the first tested non-route coordinate with zero
  mixed theorem-route fibers on this bank.
  barcode_shadow and packet_zipper then become certificate-anchor
  refinements rather than the first purity repair.
  route_labelled_packet is therefore not a shortcut; it is the endpoint
  record that the proof should reconstruct by family lemmas.

